  "id": "depressive-anxiety",
  "term": "depressive anxiety",
  "definition": "Depressive anxiety refers to a combination of depression and anxiety symptoms occurring together. In this packet, the term is used for perinatal symptoms during pregnancy and after birth that can persist or recur and may affect the mother–infant bond and child development if untreated.",
